ndon last year, and it was as if the universe brought us together.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"We bonded over our shared passion for the arts and our commitment to philanthropy.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Wither, 42, is a descendant of the prominent Wither family, known for their historical ties to the British monarchy.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"As a member of the peerage, he holds the title of Baron Wither of Selsea.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"When asked about the challenges of navigating their cross-cultural relationship, González laughed, \\\"Harris is an amazing partner.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"He's been incredibly supportive of my career, and I've learned so much about British history and culture from him.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"We balance each other out perfectly.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"The couple's wedding, which took place in a private ceremony at Wither's family estate in Sussex, England, was attended by close friends and family, including González's co-stars from her hit TV series, \\\"La Casa de los Sueños.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"According to sources close to the couple, González has been splitting her time between Buenos Aires and London, where Wither is based.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The actress has been spotted attending high-society events in the British capital, including a recent gala at the Royal Opera House.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Data from the UK's Office for National Statistics reveals that marriages between Argentine and British citizens have seen a significant increase in recent years, with 2019 marking a record high of 250 such unions.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"As González prepares to return to Argentina to begin filming her next project, she expressed her gratitude for the love and support of her fans.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm thrilled to share this new chapter of my life with the people who have been with me every step of the way.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Harris and I are excited to build a life together, and I know that our love will only continue to grow stronger.\\\"\"}]}"
